<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech MUS pretax lower at CZK 91.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech MUS pretax lower at CZK 91.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half pre-tax profit at Czech coal mining company Mostecka Uhelna a.s. (MUS).</p>
<p>(Millions of Czech crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		 91.366   vs    425.423</p>
<p> operating profit	     23.459   vs    371.411</p>
<p> depreciation		  501.193   vs    499.662</p>
<p>sales of own goods/services</p>
<p>				 4,341.144   vs  4,403.541</p>
<p> sales of other goods	  4.602   vs	3.653</p>
<p> basic capital	     8,835.898   vs  8,835.898</p>
<p> total assets	     15,102.835   vs 14,601.313</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
